To use a different name, move the cursor to ''New Name'' and press the A Button. On this screen, pressing the A Button will select a letter while pressing the B Button or selecting ''Back'' will delete the previous one. A custom name may be up to seven characters long. Pressing <sc>Select</sc> cycles through three pages of alphanumeric text and symbols. When ready, select ''OK'' in the bottom-right corner. With that done, the player is transported into the world of Pokémon to begin their adventure!

==Littleroot Town==
[[File:Littleroot Town RS.png|thumb|Littleroot Town]]

The journey begins in [[Littleroot Town]], in the southwest part of the [[Hoenn]] mainland. It is a rather small, sleepy town with only three buildings; your home, [[Professor Birch]]'s home, and the professor's Pokémon Laboratory, where he conducts research on Pokémon distribution, in the south. The north end of town leads to {{rt|101|Hoenn}}.

