===Rival Battle 1===
Cross through the tall grass to meet up with {{ga|May}}/{{ga|Brendan}}, who challenges you to a friendly battle after spotting your new Pokémon.

When battling, each Trainer sends out at least one Pokémon at a time; both of these particular Pokémon are on [[Level]] 5, indicated by the ''Lv:5'' aside each Pokémon. Below that is the health bar, which shows the Pokémon's remaining {{stat|HP}}. A battle is won or lost when either side has no remaining Pokémon with the strength to continue.

Choosing ''Fight'' will allow you to launch an attack against the target. Each of these [[first partner Pokémon]] have two moves. The first will damage the opponent, and the other will lower one of its stats. If your Pokémon's HP runs low, be sure to use a healing item, like a Potion. Go to ''Bag'' to select the medicine and apply it to the Pokémon.

